 "cell_contents": "Four nominal ABO3 formula units in the conventional orthorhombic Pbnm cell. The article reports the analytical/site-assigned composition (Mg0.88Fe3+0.065Fe2+0.035Al0.03)(Al0.11Si0.90)O3. The deposited 4.2 GPa refinement normalizes the crystallographic A and B sites to unity and therefore represents Mg0.88Fe0.09Al0.13Si0.90O3; the source does not reconcile this rounding difference.",
