 "notes": "Composition-specific record for synthetic run 5K2667. The material formula preserves the article's measured Mg0.88Fe0.10Al0.14Si0.90O3 composition; the site-assigned form is (Mg0.88Fe3+0.065Fe2+0.035Al0.03)(Al0.11Si0.90)O3. The stored diffraction structure is the official deposited 4.2 GPa, 293 K Pbnm refinement with Z=4. Its normalized occupancies give Mg0.88Fe0.09Al0.13Si0.90O3, so it is a refinement model for the same specimen and not a replacement analytical composition. The EOS V0 values are separately fitted zero-pressure conventional-cell extrapolations. The authors report BM2 and BM3 as equally acceptable within uncertainty and do not designate a preferred fit; record ordering follows Table 1 and is not a scientific preference.",
