   "notes": "Standard third-order Birch-Murnaghan pressure-volume EOS in the Eulerian finite-strain convention at 293 K. V0, K0, and K0_prime were fitted. Parenthesized coefficient errors are retained as printed, but the article does not give their confidence convention or numerical covariance. BM3 is co-reported with BM2 and is not designated preferred."
  }
 ],
